        "title": "Its a must see place",
        "text": "The biggest and most important hindu temple, the cremation place for all hindus. Its a fascinating place. The architecture of the temples are beautiful. Monkeys monkeying around. Bells ringing. Sadhus (holy men) in their attire, some even with mobile phones :). You will not get bored here.\n\nAlthough sad, watching the cremation ritual from the viewing place opposite the temple is quite fascinating. Don't forget to look at all those shivalingas built in a straight line. Its beautiful.\n\nThe only annoying thing is they charge foreigners nearly $10 when they can't even go into the temple!! Rip off I'll say.\n\nOverall, must see.",
